              "instruction": "āj sakāḷpāsūn naḷālā pāṇī nāhī. — There has been no water in the tap since this morning.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *āj sakāḷpāsūn naḷālā pāṇī nāhī.* — There has been no water in the tap since this morning.]"
